UHD 3.15 (ea137aa3) as the measuring instrument of scripts/eyescan.sh and
scripts/sample_check.py.

  * Build fixes for a current compiler and boost (asio and rpclib API use).
  * UHD_AD936X_EYESCAN: ad936x_manager::loopback_self_test runs the codec
    loopback over every clock/data delay of AD9361 registers 0x006/0x007
    and prints one EYE line per setting.
  * UHD_AD936X_BIST=<value>: written to the AD9361 BIST register 0x3F4
    whenever the active chains are set (0x1B: digital test tone at fs/32,
    -6 dBFS, on the receive data port; 0x09: pseudo-random sequence there).
  * UHD_AD936X_LOOPBACK: digital loopback of the transmit data port onto
    the receive data port (register 0x3F5).
Without these variables the library behaves as stock.

Applied and built by `scripts/toolchain.sh uhd`.

